        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Marshall Dyllon\n- People: Daniel Cahoon, Jesse Littleton, Michael Martin, Paul Martin, Todd Michael Sansom, Kenny Rogers, Lou Pearlman\n- Concepts: country music, boy band sound\n\nFacts:\n- Marshall Dyllon was an American country music group formed in 2000 with members Daniel Cahoon, Jesse Littleton, Michael Martin, Paul Martin, and Todd Michael Sansom.\n- Kenny Rogers and Lou Pearlman recruited the five members of Marshall Dyllon to bring the boy band sound to the country music scene.\n- In 2008, Lou Pearlman was convicted and sentenced to up to 25 years in prison.",
